Name: gogcli
Short Name: gogcli
URL: https://github.com/openclaw/gogcli
License: MIT
License File: LICENSE
Version: HEAD
Revision: HEAD
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
Forks:
  - https://github.com/aphrody-labs/gogcli
  - https://github.com/yolo-rs/gogcli

Description:
GOG.com CLI downloader and manifest parser written in Go. Used for digital archive verification,
game asset extraction, and preservation of Google & Inazuma Eleven related catalog data.

Local Modifications:
- Forked to aphrody-labs/gogcli and yolo-rs/gogcli.
- Enhanced with Bun subprocess integration and token synchronization for offline storage in Google Cloud Storage.
